    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for sending transactional emails and SMS, managing sender domains, SMTP users, API keys, templates, webhooks, suppressions, and accessing delivery reports and activity statistics. All requests use POST with JSON bodies. Authentication is via API key in request body or X-Smtp2go-Api-Key header.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: SMTP2GO Support",
